    <title>060. | 生活麻辣烫：悲秋、追剧、断舍离、少操心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69398c022a383da1676a1a3e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69398c022a383da1676a1a3e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期生活麻辣烫回归！异地的大许和瓜瓜，已经变成每月一次视频聊天扯家常，以此更新自己彼此生活的朋友了哈哈哈哈，话不多说，欢迎你的收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 在成都基本没有太阳的天气里，本“向日葵人”要玉玉了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 天气转凉，在悲秋的情绪里进行了一次电子断舍离；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 有些放肆地熬夜看剧，爱上和主角“共同成长”的感觉；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a> “情绪稳定”地上了这么多年班，也遭遇滑铁卢了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a> 爱操心的人一旦学会不操心，会发现这些事原来啥都不是！</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近深圳的天空好好看噢，分享给大家~~祝我们的生活常有美景！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lscuqnplE6LJAosYpleG6NjfxSj3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FioTLq2wtv8mlVKdBERa2A-nkuSU.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofSQa_h86ter0WayTuhsqhH8FYi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp4h4nNGV4OEedv3KYbDyQTYCoxr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Kate Havnevik - SoLo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 @茶熟欧；你可以在小宇宙、苹果podcast、喜马拉雅、网易云、荔枝等平台收听我们的节目。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>加入听友群及商务合作：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加微信：Pinky-16，备注小宇宙。</span></p>]]></description>
