  <item>
    <title>057. | 汕头本地人给外地游客，设计城市挑战任务</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e7c323224325ea7062e45d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e7c323224325ea7062e45d</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 09 Oct 2025 14:23:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是瓜瓜和后台播放 主播Kamin录制的串台！</span></p><span></span><p><span>源于Kamin在做一个综艺类视频「城市挑战系列」，在旅游的城市里头完成一些本地人或者朋友设置的挑战。这次的挑战城市是瓜瓜的家乡汕头，瓜瓜设置了非常个性化、在地性十足的挑战。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客属于冤有头，债有主。作为挑战者的Kamin来问问出题人的心思，解剖背后的原因，并且分享挑战过程中对汕头的感受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期播客有点长，可以慢慢听</span></p><span></span><p><span>😄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 汕头不只是美食城市，还是一座有痕迹的轻工业城市；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 挑战者暗访式接收任务，充满惊喜和亲切；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 有任务一定要有惩罚，想惩罚不简单；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 和潮汕本地人对暗号，考验E值和语言能力；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 肠粉店的老板成为本次任务中的贵人；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 家家户户真的都在冲茶，喝茶需要干杯吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> 吃三种不同类型的粿，把自己吃撑了；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3605">60:05</a> 买一条潮阳产的内裤，留下阴影的任务；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3628">60:28</a> 和初中生的意外邂逅，互关成为彼此的粉丝；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3636">60:36</a> 挑战让旅途更有趣，让自己更靠近城市；</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了找本地人要攻略，让他们设计挑战可能更好玩</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【相关信息指北】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sYtzz3EQq/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=7b238ed4e237db8d612c4c9744866de0" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1sYtzz3EQq/?spm_id_from=333.1387.homepage.video_card.click&amp;vd_source=7b238ed4e237db8d612c4c9744866de0"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a><span>，本期视频可以在这里观看。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>后台播放 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6007a59b83a0307dcaf312c6" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6007a59b83a0307dcaf312c6"><span>www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>联系我们：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书 @茶熟欧；你可以在小宇宙、苹果podcast、喜马拉雅、网易云、荔枝等平台收听我们的节目。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>加入听友群及商务合作：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>添加微信：Pinky-16，备注小宇宙。</span></p>]]></description>
